# Signing key material must never enter the public repository. The Android
# keystore is generated and stored outside the repo (repository secret
# ANDROID_KEYSTORE_B64 + private backup); a stray local keystore file in the
# working tree must be impossible to commit by accident.
*.keystore
*.jks
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key
